zarathustra","c":"III.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-55f238a2f371dd7f806cdad1f08bc576","tos.text-unit.sid-55f238a2f371dd7f806cdad1f08bc576"]},"form":"Thorwege","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"sailors","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"gateway-vision","neighbours":["identity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Паук, луна и собеседники включаются в вопрос возвращения.","en":"Spider, moon and speakers enter recurrence’s question."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-644ff83c17e4f860c7137f40386012fa","tos.text-unit.sid-644ff83c17e4f860c7137f40386012fa"]},"form":"Thorweg","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"sailors","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"gateway-vision","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Исчезновение ворот оставляет учителя одного среди скал.","en":"The gateway’s disappearance leaves the teacher alone among rocks."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-fb23cb044b07bb7f12da7e5f29161308","tos.text-unit.sid-fb23cb044b07bb7f12da7e5f29161308"]},"form":"Augenblicke","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"other-scenes","neighbours":["fate","present","identity","necessity","innocence-play","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Время открывается опытом свободы самой необходимости.","en":"Time opens through an experience of necessity itself as freedom."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.05","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-1cb5553f5085278e3affc4629d079c80","tos.text-unit.sid-1cb5553f5085278e3affc4629d079c80"]},"form":"Augenblick","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"magician","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"other-scenes","neighbours":["present","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Краткая подлинность чародея получает признание учителя.","en":"The magician’s brief authenticity receives the teacher’s recognition."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.06","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-8a8698a093651c087a2efd29ebb8d5c0","